 Command line input:
 $ /opt/crest/crest benzoic_acid.xyz -qcg water.xyz -grow -nsolv 3 -alpb water -nofix -T 4 -keepdir

  --alpb water : implicit solvation
  -T 4 (CPUs/Threads selected)

